      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Informal forum set up to foster cooperation and provide input for other international groups. It is composed of countries from Latin America, Africa, and Asia with a common goal of enhanced growth and prosperity. The G15 focuses on cooperation among developing countries in the areas of investment, trade, and technology. Membership has since expanded to 18 countries, but the name has remained unchanged.</skos:definition>
