      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The International Anti-Corruption Academy (IACA) is an international organization dedicated to overcoming current shortcomings in knowledge and practice in the field of anti-corruption and seeking to empower professionals for the challenges for tomorrow.</skos:definition>
