      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">ASEAN is a political and economic organization of ten Southeast Asian countries. Its aims include accelerating economic growth, social progress, and sociocultural evolution among its members, protection of regional peace and stability, and opportunities for member countries to resolve differences peacefully.</skos:definition>
