      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Collective Security Treaty Organization is an intergovernmental military alliance, acting as counterpart to the NATO alliance. Its member states are Armenia, Belarus, Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Russia, Tajikistan.</skos:definition>
