      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The European Research Council Executive Agency is entrusted with the implementation of the following part of Horizon Europe: Horizon Europe, pillar I: the European Research Council (ERC), as well as with the implementation of the legacy of the following (parts of) Union programmes: Horizon 2020: Part I: strengthening frontier research through the activities of the European Research Council; FP7: specific programme ‘Ideas’.</skos:definition>
      <skos:historyNote xml:lang="en">According to the Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2021/173 of 12 February 2021 (http://data.europa.eu/eli/dec_impl/2021/173/oj), the European Research Council Executive Agency is established from 1 April 2021 until 31 December 2028 and it succeeds and replaces the former European Research Council Executive Agency.</skos:historyNote>
   </skos:Concept>
