      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Scientific, Technical and Economic Committee for Fisheries (STECF) is a group of experts in the field of fisheries and aquaculture. Commission has to consult STECF where appropriate, on matters pertaining to the conservation and management of living marine resources, including biological, economic, environmental, social and technical considerations.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
