      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ga">CRO</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="el">CRO</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Chief Risk Officer develops the financial risk management and compliance framework for all the Union’s financial operations, oversees the financial risks and reports on them. The Chief Risk Officer acts in full independence from the directorates-general responsible for the Union’s financial operations and reports directly to the member of the College responsible for the budget.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
