      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="pt">Empresa Comum de Investigação sobre a Gestão do Tráfego Aéreo no Céu Único Europeu 3</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="pl">Wspólne Przedsięwzięcie w celu Badań z zakresu Zarządzania Ruchem Lotniczym w Jednolitej Europejskiej Przestrzeni Powietrznej 3</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="cs">Společný podnik pro výzkum ATM jednotného evropského nebe 3</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="sk">Spoločný podnik pre výskum manažmentu letovej prevádzky jednotného európskeho neba 3</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="sl">Skupno podjetje za raziskave o upravljanju zračnega prometa enotnega evropskega neba 3</skos:prefLabel>
      <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="ro">Întreprinderea comună „Proiectul de cercetare privind ATM în contextul Cerului unic european” 3</skos:prefLabel>
      <dc:identifier>SESAR</dc:identifier>
      <atold:op-code>SESAR</atold:op-code>
      <at:op-code>SESAR</at:op-code>
      <at:start.use>2021-11-30</at:start.use>
      <at:authority-code>SESAR</at:authority-code>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">SESAR</skos:altLabel>
      <at:op-mapped-code>
         <at:MappedCode>
            <dc:source>WHOISWHO</dc:source>
            <at:legacy-code>SESAR</at:legacy-code>
         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <at:op-mapped-code>
         <at:MappedCode>
            <dc:source>PUB</dc:source>
            <at:affected-table>PUB_CORP</at:affected-table>
            <at:legacy-code>SESAR_1</at:legacy-code>
         </at:MappedCode>
      </at:op-mapped-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Single European Sky ATM Research 3 Joint Undertaking is a public-private partnership which contributes to the general objectives of the Horizon Europe Regulation. Its general objectives are: to strengthen and integrate the Union’s research and innovation capacity in the ATM sector, making it more resilient and scalable to fluctuations in traffic while enabling the seamless operation of all aircraft; to strengthen, through innovation, the competitiveness of manned and unmanned air transport in the Union, and ATM services’ markets to support economic growth in the Union; to develop and accelerate the market uptake of innovative solutions to establish the Single European Sky airspace as the most efficient and environmentally friendly sky to fly in the world.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
