      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">EU body with legal personality whose objective it is to protect the public interest, the stability and integrity of the EU’s financial system, and the proper functioning of the internal market by, inter alia, preventing the use of the EU’s financial system for the purposes of money laundering and terrorist financing and ensuring high-quality supervision in the area of anti-money laundering and countering the financing of terrorism across the internal market</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
   <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/LISA"
