      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Circular Bio-based Europe Joint Undertaking is a public-private partnership which contributes to the general objectives of the Horizon Europe Regulation. Its general objectives are: to accelerate the innovation process and development of bio-based innovative solutions; to accelerate market deployment of the existing mature and innovative bio-based solutions; to ensure a high level of environmental performance of bio-based industrial systems.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
