      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="mt">AHWP DF</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">preparatory body supporting the Council of the EU in its position on the proposal for a Regulation on making available on the Union market as well as export from the Union of certain commodities and products associated with deforestations and forest degradation</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
