      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">preparatory body supporting the Council of the EU in issues concerning the development and conduct of cohesion policy. Its scope of work is in line with article 174 of the TFEU and it is designed to strengthen the Union’s economic, social and territorial cohesion as well as European territorial cooperation</skos:definition>
