      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">preparatory body supporting the Council of the EU in handling EU relations with countries in Latin America and the Caribbean, with regional integration bodies such as the Community of Latin American and Caribbean States (CELAC) and other sub-regional bodies</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
