      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">General Secretariat of the European Investment Bank</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Secrétariat général de la Banque européenne d’investissement</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The General Secretariat of the European Investment Bank (EIB) is responsible for implementing and monitoring the decision-making process and the provision of secretariat services for all the governing bodies in the Bank, defining institutional strategy (including the Corporate Operational Plan), providing economic analysis on the employment and growth impact of EIB activities and potential new products, coordinating and developing relations with EU institutions, international and development financing agencies and non-governmental organizations, communications and corporate responsibility. It also supervises the areas of Advisory Services as well as the Bank’s external offices.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
