      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The European Commission Library and e-Resources Centre is a primary source of information on EU policies, history and integration. The principal users of the Library and e-Resources Centre are the staff working at the European Commission and other EU institutions. Other user groups include university students, researchers and librarians who manage interlibrary loans.</skos:definition>
