      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Food and Veterinary Office carries out audits, inspections and related non-audit activities to ensure that EU legislation on food safety, animal health, animal welfare, plant health and in the area of medical devices is properly implemented and enforced.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
