      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">CERT-EU’s mission is to support the European Institutions to protect themselves against intentional and malicious attacks that would hamper the integrity of their IT assets and harm the interests of the EU. The scope of CERT-EU’s activities covers prevention, detection, response and recovery.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
