      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">service which contributes to the security of the unclassified ICT environment of Union entities by advising them on cybersecurity, by helping them to prevent, detect, handle, mitigate, respond to and recover from incidents and by acting as their cybersecurity information exchange and incident response coordination hub</skos:definition>
