      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Prepares reports and other documentation and provides substantive services to the Commission on the Status of Women; provides services to the Committee on the Elimination of Discrimination against Women. For complete list of functions, see ST/SGB/1997/9. See also Special Adviser on Gender Issues and Advancement of Women.</skos:definition>
