      <dc:identifier>UFC</dc:identifier>
      <atold:op-code>UFC</atold:op-code>
      <at:op-code>UFC</at:op-code>
      <at:start.use>2005-07-26</at:start.use>
      <at:authority-code>UFC</at:authority-code>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">UFC</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Uniting for Consensus (UfC) is a movement, nicknamed the Coffee Club, that developed in opposition to the possible expansion of permanent seats in the United Nations Security Council. Under the leadership of Italy, it aims to counter the bids for permanent seats proposed by G4 nations (Brazil, Germany, India, and Japan) and is calling for a consensus before any decision is reached on the form and size of the Security Council.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
