      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pl">Komisja Gospodarcza ds. Ameryki Łacińskiej i Karaibów</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="bg">ИКЛАК</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="lt">Lotynų Amerikos ir Karibų baseino ekonominė komisija</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="bg">Икономическа комисия за Латинска Америка и Карибския басейн</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt">Comissão Económica para a América Latina e o Caribe</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="el">Οικονομική Eπιτροπή για τη Λατινική Αμερική και την Καραϊβική</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">ECLAC is one of the five regional commissions of the United Nations. It was founded with the purpose of contributing to the economic development of Latin America, coordinating actions directed towards this end, and reinforcing economic ties among countries and with other nations of the world. The promotion of the region’s social development was later included among its primary objectives.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
