      <at:authority-code>EFTA_COUN</at:authority-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The EFTA Council is the highest governing body of the European Free Trade Association. The Council usually meets eight times a year at the ambassadorial level (heads of permanent delegations to EFTA) and twice a year at Ministerial level.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
