      <at:authority-code>EFTA_STAT</at:authority-code>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The EFTA Statistical Office (ESO) was established as a liaison office between the EFTA National Statistical Institutes and Eurostat. Although ESO’s tasks have expanded and today include activities in the field of statistical cooperation with partners beyond the EU and EFTA ("statistical capacity building"), its main objective was and still is to promote the full inclusion of the EFTA States in the continuously evolving European Statistical System.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
