      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pl">Komitet Konsultacyjny Europejskiego Obszaru Gospodarczego</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="it">Comitato consultivo dello Spazio economico europeo</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="sl">Posvetovalni odbor Evropskega gospodarskega prostora</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="cs">Poradní výbor Evropského hospodářského prostoru</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="mt">Kumitat Konsultattiv taż-Żona Ekonomika Ewropea</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="sk">Poradný výbor Európskeho hospodárskeho priestoru</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fr">Comité consultatif de l’Espace économique européen</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">European Economic Area Consultative Committee</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="el">Συμβουλευτική Επιτροπή του Ευρωπαϊκού Οικονομικού Χώρου</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ga">Coiste Comhairleach an Limistéir Eorpaigh Eacnamaíoch</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="de">Beratender Ausschuss Europäischer Wirtschaftsraum</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="es">Comité Consultivo del Espacio Económico Europeo</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ro">Comitetul consultativ al Spațiului Economic European</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="bg">Консултативен комитет на Европейското икономическо пространство</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="et">Euroopa Majanduspiirkonna nõuandekomitee</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hr">Savjetodavni odbor za Europski gospodarski prostor</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fi">Euroopan talousalueen konsultatiivinen komitea</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="lt">Europos ekonominės erdvės konsultacinis komitetas</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pt">Comité Consultivo do Espaço Económico Europeu</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="da">Det rådgivende udvalg for Det Europæiske Økonomiske Samarbejdsområde</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hu">Az Európai Gazdasági Térség konzultatív bizottsága</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="nl">Raadgevend Comité van de Europese Economische Ruimte</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="lv">Eiropas Ekonomikas zonas Konsultatīvā komiteja</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The European Economic Area Consultative Committee is part of the EEA agreement, and was created when the agreement entered into force in 1994. It represents employers, workers and other civil society players of EEA member states. Non-EU members include Iceland, Liechtenstein and Norway. Switzerland sends observers. The Committee comprises representatives of the European Economic and Social Committee and of the EFTA Consultative Committee. The Committee meets once a year. At each of its meetings, the Committee adopts resolutions and reports related to various aspects of the internal market, as well as to important developments in the EEA. The resolutions are sent to the EEA Council for information.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
