      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">European Economic Area Joint Parliamentary Committee</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="cs">Smíšený parlamentní výbor Evropského hospodářského prostoru</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="el">Μικτή Κοινοβουλευτική Επιτροπή του Ευρωπαϊκού Οικονομικού Χώρου</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="ro">Comisia parlamentară mixtă a Spațiului Economic European</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="it">Commissione parlamentare mista dello Spazio economico europeo</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="pl">Wspólny Komitet Parlamentarny Europejskiego Obszaru Gospodarczego</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hu">Az Európai Gazdasági Térség Parlamenti Vegyes Bizottsága</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="hr">Zajednički parlamentarni odbor Europskoga gospodarskog prostora</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:altLabel xml:lang="fi">Euroopan talousalueen parlamentaarinen sekakomitea</skos:altLabel>
      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The European Economic Area Joint Parliamentary Committee is an advisory body that comprises members of the national parliaments of the EEA EFTA States and Members of the European Parliament. It is not directly involved in the EEA decision-making process, but through reports and resolutions it aims to monitor and scrutinise EEA-relevant EU policies and decisions adopted in the EEA Joint Committee.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
