      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Migration Policy Centre produces advanced policy-oriented research on global migration, asylum and mobility to serve migration governance needs at European and global levels, from developing, implementing and monitoring migration-related policies to assessing their impact on the wider economy and society.</skos:definition>
