      <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Robert Schuman Centre for Advanced Studies is an inter-disciplinary research centre inside the European University Institute. Its mission is to develop high quality interdisciplinary and policy-oriented research on the dynamics of European integration and Europe’s global role.</skos:definition>
   </skos:Concept>
